sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client (Spark/SDK)
    participant Proxy as Storage Bridge
    participant Blob as Azure Blob Storage

    Note over Client,Blob: Step 1: Client lists containers
    Client->>Proxy: GET /api?comp=list
    Proxy->>Blob: GET /?comp=list (Bearer token)
    Blob-->>Proxy: 200 OK - XML with ServiceEndpoint
    Proxy-->>Client: 200 OK - XML rewritten

    Note over Client,Blob: Step 2: Client follows rewritten URL
    Client->>Proxy: GET /api/data/file.csv
    Proxy->>Blob: GET /data/file.csv (Bearer token)